{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53813","headline":"闻裴李二舍人拜纶阁 · 白居易","name":"闻裴李二舍人拜纶阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤池後面新秋月，龙阙前头薄暮山。\n（见前书卷下《禁中》）（〖1〗川口久雄校注云：「《佳句·早秋》及《禁中》作『白《闻裴李二舍人拜纶阁》』。\n私注作『《题东北旧院小亭》，白』。\n《文集》及《全唐诗》均未见。\n《江谈》四作《同裴李文拜纶阁》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}